experiment: aimgain
  instrument        aimgain   trial seed 00000000013586c7   6 creatures
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  the question      WHERE IS THE F1 ACTUATOR LINEAR, and is it
                    SYMMETRIC? stageprobe put 61% of the usable swing
                    in its first rung and never tested negative k.
  why it matters    a feedback controller lives below k=0.25 and must
                    correct BOTH ways. An asymmetric actuator biases
                    the voice rather than steadying it.

  k        F1 (Hz)        dF1 from 0  Hz per 0.06 k
